{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/programming' data-target='computer\/programming' data-title='Programming'>\r\n\t\t\tProgramming\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/programming\/visual_cpp' data-target='computer\/programming\/visual_cpp' data-title='Visual C++'>\r\n\t\t\tVisual C++\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Working notes on Project Setup: Configuration Properties, General, 1. Single Project - Solution, Output Directory, Output Directory, and 2. Multi Project - Solution.","label":"Project Setup","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/programming\/visual_cpp\/language_resource_dll","label":"Language Resource DLL","url":"\/computer\/programming\/visual_cpp\/language_resource_dll"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/programming\/visual_cpp\/project_structure","label":"Project Structure","url":"\/computer\/programming\/visual_cpp\/project_structure"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\t{Project} Property Pages.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Configuration Properties<\/h2>\n\t<h4>General<\/h4>\n\t<h2>1. Single Project - Solution<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<strong>Platform.<\/strong> Win32.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Output Directory<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>$(SolutionDir)\\x86\\$(ConfigurationName)\\$(ProjectName)<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<strong>Platform.<\/strong> X64.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Output Directory<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>$(SolutionDir)\\$(PlatformName)\\$(ConfigurationName)\\$(ProjectName)<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>2. Multi Project - Solution<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<strong>Platform.<\/strong> Win32.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Output Directory<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>$(SolutionDir)\\x86\\$(ConfigurationName)\\[Container]\\$(ProjectName)<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<strong>Platform.<\/strong> X64.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Output Directory<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>$(SolutionDir)\\$(PlatformName)\\$(ConfigurationName)\\[Container]\\$(ProjectName)<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<ul class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>All entries to be \u2018\\\u2019 separated.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\t<h2>Intermediate Directory<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>$(OutDir)\\Interim<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tC\/C++.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Additional Include Directory<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>$(ProjectDir)\\..; $(ProjectDir)<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t[Resource DLL].\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Linker<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tGeneral.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Output File<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>$(OutDir)\\Engine\\Lang\\$(ProjectName).DLL.mui<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRenaming Platform \u2018Win32\u2019 to \u2018x86\u2019 not feasible.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tAll Projects get their Individual Directories.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tMulti Solution Projects - under Container.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRun dependencies to be provided by sym-links.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/programming\/visual_cpp\/project_setup\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/programming\/visual_cpp\/project_setup\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  dat